(7207097, 1110200, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I''m afraid I can''t give it an outstanding vote for a couple of reasons:<br/>-The image seems very grainy and low resolution. Perhaps this is an extreme crop of a larger image?<br/>-I feel to some extent that I am voting on the talent of the mural artist and not the photographer.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I''m afraid I can''t give it an outstanding vote for a couple of reasons:-The image seems very grainy and low resolution. Perhaps this is an extreme crop of a larger image?-I feel to some extent that I am voting on the talent of the mural artist and not the photographer.', '2014-04-23 01:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207106, 1110221, 114285, '<td valign="top">guess who didn''t  read the challenge description!~</td>', 'guess who didn''t  read the challenge description!~', '2014-04-23 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
