(7208056, 1110224, 140305, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t understand how this relates to the topic. I would have to assume this is taken through a window......but not sure. It is an interesting composition though.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t understand how this relates to the topic. I would have to assume this is taken through a window......but not sure. It is an interesting composition though.', '2014-04-24 21:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
