(7208656, 1110199, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the bands of color and texture.  The processing is a bit over the top and detracts from the "feel" of the image.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the bands of color and texture.  The processing is a bit over the top and detracts from the "feel" of the image.', '2014-04-26 17:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208659, 1110107, 91496, '<td valign="top">The gargoyle is great.  The window is only so-so as there is nothing special about it to grab my interest.</td>', 'The gargoyle is great.  The window is only so-so as there is nothing special about it to grab my interest.', '2014-04-26 17:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208661, 1109649, 91496, '<td valign="top">I love the light and the oolors here.  The windows are kind of a secondary subject to the clothes.</td>', 'I love the light and the oolors here.  The windows are kind of a secondary subject to the clothes.', '2014-04-26 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208665, 1110094, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the point of view here, with the great angle and framing.  While the window is the whole image it still seems secondary to the outside scene,</td>', 'Love the point of view here, with the great angle and framing.  While the window is the whole image it still seems secondary to the outside scene,', '2014-04-26 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208666, 1110223, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen.  I think a vertical of the left hand side us a much more powerful image.</td>', 'Nicely seen.  I think a vertical of the left hand side us a much more powerful image.', '2014-04-26 17:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208668, 1110049, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and symmetry here.  If the vertical were straighted this would add to the effect.  The artistic/cartoon/hdr processing does not work for me.</td>', 'I like the framing and symmetry here.  If the vertical were straighted this would add to the effect.  The artistic/cartoon/hdr processing does not work for me.', '2014-04-26 17:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208670, 1109861, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures.  The window with glass coonection seems weak.</td>', 'Great colors and textures.  The window with glass coonection seems weak.', '2014-04-26 17:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208677, 1110177, 91496, '<td valign="top">Vert well done of course.  But is this about the window or about the women and the water drops?</td>', 'Vert well done of course.  But is this about the window or about the women and the water drops?', '2014-04-26 17:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208680, 1109717, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen -- great contrast of color and texture.  I wonder if square-ish of the upper half would be a stronger composition</td>', 'Nicely seen -- great contrast of color and texture.  I wonder if square-ish of the upper half would be a stronger composition', '2014-04-26 17:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208683, 1110200, 91496, '<td valign="top">Ver well framed.  The windows support and enhance the picture.</td>', 'Ver well framed.  The windows support and enhance the picture.', '2014-04-26 17:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208687, 1110221, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I wish the window thene was more prominant.  The catchlights are to die for!</td>', 'Great image.  I wish the window thene was more prominant.  The catchlights are to die for!', '2014-04-26 18:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208693, 1109765, 91496, '<td valign="top">TI likr the lightinghere.  The windows seems rather seondary here, not to mention the lack of glass.</td>', 'TI likr the lightinghere.  The windows seems rather seondary here, not to mention the lack of glass.', '2014-04-26 18:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208886, 1110147, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is a charming collage-like image with colors, shapes and textures effortlessly juggled into a confection of harmonious composition.  There is a sense that something old and perhaps forgotten - the window - contains boundless treasures.  My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a charming collage-like image with colors, shapes and textures effortlessly juggled into a confection of harmonious composition.  There is a sense that something old and perhaps forgotten - the window - contains boundless treasures.  My favorite in the challenge.', '2014-04-27 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208983, 1110081, 175475, '<td valign="top">Is this Cabot Circus in Bristol? :D I like it!</td>', 'Is this Cabot Circus in Bristol? :D I like it!', '2014-04-27 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7208997, 1109753, 24983, '<td valign="top">very nice photo interesting</td>', 'very nice photo interesting', '2014-04-27 20:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209003, 1110221, 24983, '<td valign="top">a very good image which is well shot and presented but I feel does not meet the terms of the challenge .<br/> <br/>Most important to read the brief otherwise you get bitten in the b*m.</td>', 'a very good image which is well shot and presented but I feel does not meet the terms of the challenge . Most important to read the brief otherwise you get bitten in the b*m.', '2014-04-27 20:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
