(7209773, 1109941, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the window part!  Those dark shadows!  So wonderful!<br/> <br/>Is it all in color?  Or is it partially desaturated?  I''m torn between the sweet pose of the girl being B/W since I love the window so much and then it jars me when I get to the girl.  <br/> <br/>Still... I''m not sure.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I love the window part!  Those dark shadows!  So wonderful! Is it all in color?  Or is it partially desaturated?  I''m torn between the sweet pose of the girl being B/W since I love the window so much and then it jars me when I get to the girl.   Still... I''m not sure.  (commenting only)', '2014-04-29 12:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
