(7209775, 1110081, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the upper and lower parts of this image.   The middle glass highlights being blown upsets the serenity of the image to me...  I''d have been tempted to give up the upper windows to crop out the blown part.  But.. .I''m not sure.    Try it and see.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I love the upper and lower parts of this image.   The middle glass highlights being blown upsets the serenity of the image to me...  I''d have been tempted to give up the upper windows to crop out the blown part.  But.. .I''m not sure.    Try it and see.  (commenting only)', '2014-04-29 12:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
