(7209778, 1110011, 86447, '<td valign="top">Way cool!   One of my favorites!<br/> <br/> <br/>All of those textures and colors... add in the angle... I love it!<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Way cool!   One of my favorites!  All of those textures and colors... add in the angle... I love it!  (commenting only)', '2014-04-29 12:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209804, 1109958, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mysteriously provocative, this image goes to show how much a lively imagination can do with a pedestrian assignment.  I love the shadow and its background of yellow light.  This is balanced by the view out the window, which reminds me of Italian renaissance paintings.  Very satisfying.</td>', 'Mysteriously provocative, this image goes to show how much a lively imagination can do with a pedestrian assignment.  I love the shadow and its background of yellow light.  This is balanced by the view out the window, which reminds me of Italian renaissance paintings.  Very satisfying.', '2014-04-29 14:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209817, 1109747, 173844, '<td valign="top">The high key treatment here admirably sets off the interesting window and frame.  The simple title is apt.  Titling it "Window" would work, too.  Has an old west feel, as if a gunfighter is crouching down within, reloading his colt .45.</td>', 'The high key treatment here admirably sets off the interesting window and frame.  The simple title is apt.  Titling it "Window" would work, too.  Has an old west feel, as if a gunfighter is crouching down within, reloading his colt .45.', '2014-04-29 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209822, 1110207, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully colored and patterned image, so like a painting or stained glass.  It makes me smile; I find it cheerful, and am happy to know that there are windows out there like this.</td>', 'Beautifully colored and patterned image, so like a painting or stained glass.  It makes me smile; I find it cheerful, and am happy to know that there are windows out there like this.', '2014-04-29 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209826, 1109688, 173844, '<td valign="top">Close study of time-textured glass and peeling paint well worth considered attention.  The slice of context to the right is also very appealing.  The woman, the bulldog, the up-sloping, curving walk with a figure in the distance.  Really well done.</td>', 'Close study of time-textured glass and peeling paint well worth considered attention.  The slice of context to the right is also very appealing.  The woman, the bulldog, the up-sloping, curving walk with a figure in the distance.  Really well done.', '2014-04-29 16:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209845, 1110246, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice reflected scene that you can walk into.  It seems to have taken over the "reality" to the right.  The sepia treatment works well.  The dreary weather also works in the overall mood.</td>', 'Nice reflected scene that you can walk into.  It seems to have taken over the "reality" to the right.  The sepia treatment works well.  The dreary weather also works in the overall mood.', '2014-04-29 16:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
