(7209891, 1109938, 86447, '<td valign="top">I suppose it was hard to figure out which line to align as level...   I can''t decide myself.  Or... is the window actually not right angles?<br/> <br/>Love the idea of the toilet paper.  Mundane makes it interesting.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I suppose it was hard to figure out which line to align as level...   I can''t decide myself.  Or... is the window actually not right angles? Love the idea of the toilet paper.  Mundane makes it interesting.  (commenting only)', '2014-04-29 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209892, 1110141, 173844, '<td valign="top">Measured, muted composition.  The greens are beautiful.  I find the entire image to be elegant in its dishevelment.</td>', 'Measured, muted composition.  The greens are beautiful.  I find the entire image to be elegant in its dishevelment.', '2014-04-29 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209898, 1109941, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sweet, unpretentious image.  The girl is cute and serene.  Her hands and arms are beautifully positioned, as is her head, with its line of reflection on her dark hair.  The window is a terrific frame for her.  The cross pieces look like a Chinese character.  The graininess imbues it with a painterly feel.</td>', 'Sweet, unpretentious image.  The girl is cute and serene.  Her hands and arms are beautifully positioned, as is her head, with its line of reflection on her dark hair.  The window is a terrific frame for her.  The cross pieces look like a Chinese character.  The graininess imbues it with a painterly feel.', '2014-04-29 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209900, 1110049, 67258, '<td valign="top">The processing is quite interesting, and nearly works for me, but has gone just a little too over the top.  You have some fairly heavy haloing going on, especially on the right hand side, and you do need to give your sensor a good clean!</td>', 'The processing is quite interesting, and nearly works for me, but has gone just a little too over the top.  You have some fairly heavy haloing going on, especially on the right hand side, and you do need to give your sensor a good clean!', '2014-04-29 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209902, 1109800, 67258, '<td valign="top">Surreal!  I can only guess that these are peep holes of some sort at a zoo?  Makes for a very strange but effective photograph.</td>', 'Surreal!  I can only guess that these are peep holes of some sort at a zoo?  Makes for a very strange but effective photograph.', '2014-04-29 16:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209903, 1110089, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title reference to the great Hitchcock film already piques my appreciation.  Now I can look at the picture, and I like what I see.  The view is restful and reassuring.  The plant leads the eye to the window which opens out on your neighborhood, which is a calm recession of planes.  Nice.</td>', 'The title reference to the great Hitchcock film already piques my appreciation.  Now I can look at the picture, and I like what I see.  The view is restful and reassuring.  The plant leads the eye to the window which opens out on your neighborhood, which is a calm recession of planes.  Nice.', '2014-04-29 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209905, 1109503, 173844, '<td valign="top">The enormous windows here function to let in the radiance of the day, which opens up the soaring architecture.  The black and white treatment works well.  The standing man firms up the scale, yet there''s a door in the far distant wall that''s seemingly appropriate for Alice in Wonderland.  A vacation-style photo that glows.</td>', 'The enormous windows here function to let in the radiance of the day, which opens up the soaring architecture.  The black and white treatment works well.  The standing man firms up the scale, yet there''s a door in the far distant wall that''s seemingly appropriate for Alice in Wonderland.  A vacation-style photo that glows.', '2014-04-29 17:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209908, 1109763, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even in the sunlight the shadow looks ominous, coupled with the blocked up view of the building''s interior.  Yet one is at the same time noting the fine texture of the wood planking.  Terrific evocation of mood.</td>', 'Even in the sunlight the shadow looks ominous, coupled with the blocked up view of the building''s interior.  Yet one is at the same time noting the fine texture of the wood planking.  Terrific evocation of mood.', '2014-04-29 17:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209918, 1109649, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, however, given the subject matter selected it seems that the windows are an after thought.</td>', 'I like the photo, however, given the subject matter selected it seems that the windows are an after thought.', '2014-04-29 17:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209937, 1110143, 30049, '<td valign="top">... but it''s supposed to be a show of windows.  ???</td>', '... but it''s supposed to be a show of windows.  ???', '2014-04-29 19:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209962, 1110115, 173844, '<td valign="top">An ordinary window display is transformed by a gorgeous sunset.  This stunning image is capable of shaking one out stagnant visual habits by insisting that beauty is possible every which way you turn.  And the more you look the more you''ll find.</td>', 'An ordinary window display is transformed by a gorgeous sunset.  This stunning image is capable of shaking one out stagnant visual habits by insisting that beauty is possible every which way you turn.  And the more you look the more you''ll find.', '2014-04-29 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209963, 1110171, 173844, '<td valign="top">This extremely becoming image is partly photo-realistic, partly like an impressionistic oil painting.  That''s the window and the wall.  And featuring the wall to such an extent is fully warranted by its gritty beauty.  Anyway, I''m a sucker for old brickwork.  The window strikes me as a sun.  The rows of bricks, especially those flaring from above, are like rays, enhanced by splashes of yellow and red.  Mesmerizing.</td>', 'This extremely becoming image is partly photo-realistic, partly like an impressionistic oil painting.  That''s the window and the wall.  And featuring the wall to such an extent is fully warranted by its gritty beauty.  Anyway, I''m a sucker for old brickwork.  The window strikes me as a sun.  The rows of bricks, especially those flaring from above, are like rays, enhanced by splashes of yellow and red.  Mesmerizing.', '2014-04-29 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209964, 1110097, 173844, '<td valign="top">First this is about lines and the shapes they encompass.  Nicely done.  Then, secondly, it''s about the people,and pictures of people, sprinkled about the train in harmonious fashion, in their various attitudes.  Very nicely done.  It would make a terrific poster.</td>', 'First this is about lines and the shapes they encompass.  Nicely done.  Then, secondly, it''s about the people,and pictures of people, sprinkled about the train in harmonious fashion, in their various attitudes.  Very nicely done.  It would make a terrific poster.', '2014-04-29 22:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209965, 1110177, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sensual, and more so than if the wet glass weren''t there.  The cobalt blue, red and flesh tones really stand out.  Almost dream-like.  Her closed left eyelid, patterned by water drops, looks like a planet transiting  her face.  Excellent.</td>', 'Wonderfully sensual, and more so than if the wet glass weren''t there.  The cobalt blue, red and flesh tones really stand out.  Almost dream-like.  Her closed left eyelid, patterned by water drops, looks like a planet transiting  her face.  Excellent.', '2014-04-29 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209966, 1109649, 173844, '<td valign="top">Serene. Clean image, clean laundry.  The windows themselves are an uninteresting afterthought, but that''s fine since it''s all about pure simplicity.  The clothing, on a nice bias, confidently (to ascribe attitude to fabric) contrast with the red building.</td>', 'Serene. Clean image, clean laundry.  The windows themselves are an uninteresting afterthought, but that''s fine since it''s all about pure simplicity.  The clothing, on a nice bias, confidently (to ascribe attitude to fabric) contrast with the red building.', '2014-04-29 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209967, 1110002, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even without the bottom half of this image this would be beautiful in its own way.  The windows are poetically ramshackle and in lovely light.  The stuff before the house and within, well, it is what it is.  Now add the expanse of blue flowers and you have something special.  It''s a magical setting.</td>', 'Even without the bottom half of this image this would be beautiful in its own way.  The windows are poetically ramshackle and in lovely light.  The stuff before the house and within, well, it is what it is.  Now add the expanse of blue flowers and you have something special.  It''s a magical setting.', '2014-04-29 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209969, 1109812, 173844, '<td valign="top">The window here is more implied than evident, but done in such a strong and simple fashion that, for me at least, it''s of small note.  The person''s look and three fingers are perfect.  The success of this image hinges on the clarity of whites, and that''s nailed too.</td>', 'The window here is more implied than evident, but done in such a strong and simple fashion that, for me at least, it''s of small note.  The person''s look and three fingers are perfect.  The success of this image hinges on the clarity of whites, and that''s nailed too.', '2014-04-29 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209970, 1109839, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome set of distortions in these four windows which makes a unified image.  The colors pleasantly harmonize.  Sleek and modern but not at all in your face.  To nit pick, it''s a bit tilted.</td>', 'Handsome set of distortions in these four windows which makes a unified image.  The colors pleasantly harmonize.  Sleek and modern but not at all in your face.  To nit pick, it''s a bit tilted.', '2014-04-29 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209971, 1110140, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image is interesting and confounding in its use of self-referential reflections and disparate elements.  The woman''s attitude is great.  When I say that this is arty I by no means mean pretentious.  It''s arresting and piques the mind.</td>', 'This image is interesting and confounding in its use of self-referential reflections and disparate elements.  The woman''s attitude is great.  When I say that this is arty I by no means mean pretentious.  It''s arresting and piques the mind.', '2014-04-29 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209972, 1109547, 173844, '<td valign="top">This ragamuffin image, eyes, disheveled hair and green mouth, is both sad and amusing.  It''s well observed.  Good combination of textures.</td>', 'This ragamuffin image, eyes, disheveled hair and green mouth, is both sad and amusing.  It''s well observed.  Good combination of textures.', '2014-04-29 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209983, 1109503, 50695, '<td valign="top">some points for the Hair reference</td>', 'some points for the Hair reference', '2014-04-29 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209984, 1110177, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, and it should place highly if not ribbon. I''m feeling I have to split hairs though and say that it is not about the window, it''s about the model. Really divided on how to vote this one.</td>', 'Excellent photo, and it should place highly if not ribbon. I''m feeling I have to split hairs though and say that it is not about the window, it''s about the model. Really divided on how to vote this one.', '2014-04-29 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
