(7210106, 1110177, 124815, '<td valign="top">I would not apply the title voyeur to your image. Voyeur shall be used carefully and of course we have an inkling of how Lynch really applied it.qq<br/>Voyeur means:<br/>n.<br/>1. A person who derives sexual gratification from observing the naked bodies or sexual acts of others, especially from a secret vantage point.<br/>2. An obsessive observer of sordid or sensational subjects.<br/> <br/>And your nice lady is more meditating than spying</td>', 'I would not apply the title voyeur to your image. Voyeur shall be used carefully and of course we have an inkling of how Lynch really applied it.qqVoyeur means:n.1. A person who derives sexual gratification from observing the naked bodies or sexual acts of others, especially from a secret vantage point.2. An obsessive observer of sordid or sensational subjects. And your nice lady is more meditating than spying', '2014-04-30 03:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
