(7210229, 1109765, 19944, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LN13:</b></div><hr/><i> If this isn''t a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tanguera</a>, you''ve done a great job capturing her style, even if you weren''t trying to. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fooled me!  A great photo.  Congrats on the yellow.</td>', 'Originally posted by LN13: If this isn''t a  Tanguera, you''ve done a great job capturing her style, even if you weren''t trying to.   Fooled me!  A great photo.  Congrats on the yellow.', '2014-04-30 07:58:24.000000', NULL, 0),
