(7210306, 1110011, 50641, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Great palette and patina. A ribbon on your 5th entry...  clearly all your careful observations and thoughtful analyses have paid off early.  Let us know what street when you get a chance.</td>', 'Congratulations! Great palette and patina. A ribbon on your 5th entry...  clearly all your careful observations and thoughtful analyses have paid off early.  Let us know what street when you get a chance.', '2014-04-30 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
