(7210312, 1110177, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i>...And your nice lady is more meditating than spying </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I assumed we were spying on her. Beautifully executed, Samantha.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca:...And your nice lady is more meditating than spying  I assumed we were spying on her. Beautifully executed, Samantha.', '2014-04-30 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7210314, 1109765, 138630, '<td valign="top">What does glass have to do with it?  I just took that part of the description as a way to distinguish openings in walls from other possible interpretations such as computers, in envelopes, figurative like window of opportunity, etc.  No matter - at least it ribboned.  It''s stunning.  Congratulations.</td>', 'What does glass have to do with it?  I just took that part of the description as a way to distinguish openings in walls from other possible interpretations such as computers, in envelopes, figurative like window of opportunity, etc.  No matter - at least it ribboned.  It''s stunning.  Congratulations.', '2014-04-30 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7210315, 1110081, 19825, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see you back, Doctor. Nice phone shot, but you will have trouble taking a fly images with that phone. Congratulations on the PhD. I know what you mean about getting too wrapped up in DPC. Enter what you like -- to Heck with the score. I''ll look forward to seeing it.<br/> <br/>p.s. Get a camera.<br/>p.p.s. I recently got a Fuji X100s and I like it a lot. You may be looking for something with more heft, though.</td>', 'It''s good to see you back, Doctor. Nice phone shot, but you will have trouble taking a fly images with that phone. Congratulations on the PhD. I know what you mean about getting too wrapped up in DPC. Enter what you like -- to Heck with the score. I''ll look forward to seeing it. p.s. Get a camera.p.p.s. I recently got a Fuji X100s and I like it a lot. You may be looking for something with more heft, though.', '2014-04-30 12:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7210316, 1110177, 131871, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i>...And your nice lady is more meditating than spying </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I assumed we were spying on her. Beautifully executed, Samantha. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep! Mark, you nailed it. :) I never intended the image to be OF a voyeur...the image is implying the audience, the viewer, is the voyeur.</td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: Originally posted by mariuca:...And your nice lady is more meditating than spying  I assumed we were spying on her. Beautifully executed, Samantha.   Yep! Mark, you nailed it. :) I never intended the image to be OF a voyeur...the image is implying the audience, the viewer, is the voyeur.', '2014-04-30 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
