(7210642, 1109688, 20799, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, an image made to win. In its own concept, it''s almost too perfect, everything is perfectly cut, nothing out of place. I almost want to find a flaw. But I''m repeatedly drawn to that path in the distance, reminding me of DaVinci. Fabulous, congrats on the double blue!</td>', 'Fantastic, an image made to win. In its own concept, it''s almost too perfect, everything is perfectly cut, nothing out of place. I almost want to find a flaw. But I''m repeatedly drawn to that path in the distance, reminding me of DaVinci. Fabulous, congrats on the double blue!', '2014-05-01 05:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7210676, 1109688, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tome:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic, an image made to win. In its own concept, it''s almost too perfect, everything is perfectly cut, nothing out of place. I almost want to find a flaw. But I''m repeatedly drawn to that path in the distance, reminding me of DaVinci. Fabulous, congrats on the double blue! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Goodness. Thank you!</td>', 'Originally posted by tome: Fantastic, an image made to win. In its own concept, it''s almost too perfect, everything is perfectly cut, nothing out of place. I almost want to find a flaw. But I''m repeatedly drawn to that path in the distance, reminding me of DaVinci. Fabulous, congrats on the double blue!   Goodness. Thank you!', '2014-05-01 08:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
