(7211437, 1109649, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the photo, however, given the subject matter selected it seems that the windows are an after thought. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Waaah!  I''m the only comment you didn''t "like"?  :-D  Didn''t put enough sugar on it I guess.<br/> <br/>Similar thoughts posted ...<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bobnospum:</b></div><hr/><i> I love the light and the oolors here.  The <b>windows are kind of a secondary subject</b> to the clothes. </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> ... <b>The windows themselves are an uninteresting afterthought</b>, but that''s fine since it''s all about pure simplicity. ...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>... funny how that works.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM (5th place finish) however.</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: I like the photo, however, given the subject matter selected it seems that the windows are an after thought.   Waaah!  I''m the only comment you didn''t "like"?  :-D  Didn''t put enough sugar on it I guess. Similar thoughts posted ... Originally posted by bobnospum: I love the light and the oolors here.  The windows are kind of a secondary subject to the clothes.  Originally posted by streetpigeon: ... The windows themselves are an uninteresting afterthought, but that''s fine since it''s all about pure simplicity. ...  ... funny how that works. Congrats on the HM (5th place finish) however.', '2014-05-02 20:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
